          "description": "Experience Lunar New Year through Kaylin's eyes, learn what it's like to be a morsel of matzah who dreams of being bread, deliver Easter eggs with the Easter Skunk, try to fast for the first time during Ramadan with Saleem, and help the elephants and the bees prepare for Holi in these 5 stories celebrating the coming of Spring!\n\nWritten by Joe Vitale",
